[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13922.229, "timestamp": "03:52:02", "text": "别说了，他会非常难过的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13924.309, "timestamp": "03:52:04", "text": "因为他显然有家庭。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13926.79, "timestamp": "03:52:06", "text": "想和他们一起去，玩得开心，享受一段时光"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13931.269, "timestamp": "03:52:11", "text": "玩得很开心。所以，你也必须接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13933.67, "timestamp": "03:52:13", "text": "他会体谅对方的感受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.59, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "考虑做出该决定。但得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13940.79, "timestamp": "03:52:20", "text": "猜猜看，你会得到这个。如果那家伙总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13943.51, "timestamp": "03:52:23", "text": "这种情况至少发生了三次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.389, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "一周之内，你得竖起中指，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13947.91, "timestamp": "03:52:27", "text": "得把脚放下来，就像，“嘿”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13950.07, "timestamp": "03:52:30", "text": "伙计，听着。如果你打算"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13952.63, "timestamp": "03:52:32", "text": "我不知道要休这么多天假。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13955.429, "timestamp": "03:52:35", "text": "我该拿你怎么办？那么你应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13958.07, "timestamp": "03:52:38", "text": "把事实放在首位。那么你就必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13960.469, "timestamp": "03:52:40", "text": "逻辑至上。那么你就必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13962.15, "timestamp": "03:52:42", "text": "把严格要求放在首位。就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13964.469, "timestamp": "03:52:44", "text": "必须严格遵守，嘿，伙计，听着，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13966.229, "timestamp": "03:52:46", "text": "那次放你走是因为你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13968.229, "timestamp": "03:52:48", "text": "你想找点乐子。如果你工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13970.71, "timestamp": "03:52:50", "text": "很好，你工作很努力，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13972.469, "timestamp": "03:52:52", "text": "因为你工作能力强，不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13974.229, "timestamp": "03:52:54", "text": "这意味着你可以只休息一天，或者全部时间休息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.15, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13978.07, "timestamp": "03:52:58", "text": "一次。你不能那样做。你只能"}]